OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUS bans DeepSeek AI from government use
OL,4,Aas tech tension with China continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the DHS notice did not detail the
OL,7,Fexact security concerns surrounding
OL,8,FDeepSeek, the White House has this year
OL,9,Fcriticised AI firms from China.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
